 m_aMissionDescriptors {
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{632771FB5C619E1C}" {
   m_sTitle "Welcome / How to Play"
   m_sTextData "Welcome to a COALITION Session."\
   ""\
   "If this is your first time here, please join the discord:"\
   "Escape -> Server Message -> Join Discord"\
   ""\
   "COALITION hosts one-life missions every Friday. Each session will have, at minimum, 3 missions a night."\
   ""\
   "Anyone can join the mission, but after a mission starts, join in progress (JIP) is disabled and you must wait until the next mission to take part."\
   ""\
   "If the mission has not started yet, please take time to familiarize yourself with the rest of the briefing and then hold U to select a slot."\
   ""\
   ""\
   ""
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425053BDE568A1}" {
   m_sTitle "Custom Controls"
   m_sTextData "Custom Controls (Keyboard/Controller)"\
   ""\
   "WHILE ALIVE:"\
   "Hold U / Hold View - Open Lobby"\
   "HOME / Menu + D-pad Right - Squad Settings"\
   "CTRL + Home / Menu + D-pad Left - Personal Squad Settings"\
   "F9 / Menu + D-pad Up - Toggle Side Ready"\
   "LCtrl + Space / RB + A Button - Place Static Weapon"\
   "LCtrl + X / RB + B Button - Cancel Static Weapon"\
   ""\
   "IN SPECTATOR:"\
   "L / Y Button - Toggle spectator/alive chat"\
   "N / 2x D-pad Right - Enable night vision "\
   ""\
   "CHAT COMMANDS:"\
   "/a <message> - Message admins"
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250503DF684C0}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Good Neighbours"
   m_sTextData "Lore: there's a rebel group's after receiving some shipments of explosives off the hevossalmi coastline. there in the process of moving them when occupying British forces come barrelling down. "\
   "   "\
   "Mission Type: Search and Destroy"\
   ""\
   "INDFOR: Rebels Defending   "\
   ""\
   "INDFOR Assets x1 gunTruck  x1 Sniper."\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR: British force Attacking"\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR Assets x2 fv721 foxs "\
   ""\
   ""\
   "Time: 10:00:00"\
   ""\
   "Weather: rain"
   m_aFactionKeys {
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Got information from command, that some rebels have gotten their hands on some serious levels of Ordinances. swifty rectify this and restore control over the town. "\
   " "\
   "locate and dispose of the cached explosives before it's too late, recognisance shows that there been a lot of movement near the town's playground. suspected location of one of the bombs the other whereabouts is still unknown. "\
   ""\
   "mission makers notes:"\
   "1. the first bomb site is possibly located in the playground of the main town. "\
   "2. be perspective of potential booby traps around the town. "\
   "3. utilize all assets given."\
   "4. glfh"
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "If OPFOR is playable, add mission objectives in bullet point list. Add details for each if you feel necessary, but keep it concise."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
   m_sTitle "INDFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "After offloading the 2 main shipments of ordinances. we've got to get them stashed away, Quickly out of sight from prying eyes. But apparently a Scout has spotted Heavy Military troop movement Approaching from the north, Better drop The hauling and pick up fighting positions. Even use some of the ordinances. To booby trap the surrounding buildings and road blocking vehicels to slow down the advancement of the troops. They cannot secure. The Ordnance Caches At all cost. "\
   ""\
   ""\
   "missiom maker notes: "\
   "1. please stay in the town proper area."\
   "2. there is a surplus of demo and civ vehicals. put two and two  together... youll figure it out. "\
   "3. expected advance form the north"\
   "4. utilize all assets given."\
   "5. glfh"
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{6442505149CF6C93}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData "idk hope your having a good day, if unsure on something consult/message me in game,"
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
 }
